# Quick Links

When adding new homepage Quick Links, append them to the end of the `QUICK_LINKS` array in `app.js`. Do not reorder existing links or insert new ones next to similar items.

Add a matching icon in `iconSvg` if needed. Open each link in a new tab, same as the existing items.
